THE DATASET AND THE CASE DOCUMENT

The Cardiac market dataset and the case study document supplied with Ascend
Season 4 are the property of the competition organisers. They are not
distributed with this repository, they are excluded from version control, and
they are not licensed under these terms. Obtain them from the organisers.

The build records a SHA-256 of the workbook it read, so any published figure
can be tied back to the input that produced it without the input itself being
present here.

DERIVED FIGURES

Charts, scorecards and the presentation decks in this repository are derived
from that dataset. They are included because they are the submission. They
carry the organisers' restrictions, not the MIT licence.

